{"text": "A person who lives eighty years lives some twenty nine thousand days, and the overwhelming majority of the behaviour packed into them runs on settings laid down, most of them, decades earlier and rarely inspected since. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This need not be a hopeless thought. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In one light it is a triumph of engineering. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If you had to consciously decide every footstep and every fork grip and every word, you would never make it out of bed, the deliberate mind is far too slow and too costly to run a whole life in real time, and any creature that tried would be outcompeted by a creature that did not. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The automation is precisely what frees the captain to come up on deck for the few problems that actually require him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The default is not a flaw in the human design. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is arguably the central feature, the thing that makes a complex life affordable at all.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", " ", "p", "e", "r", "s", "o", "n", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "s", " ", "e", "i", "g", "h", "t", "y", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", "s", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "s", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", " ", "t", "w", "e", "n", "t", "y", " ", "n", "i", "n", "e", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "s", "a", "n", "d", " ", "d", "a", "y", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "v", "e", "r", "w", "h", "e", "l", "m", "i", "n", "g", " ", "m", "a", "j", "o", "r", "i", "t", "y", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "e", "h", "a", "v", "i", "o", "u", "r", " ", "p", "a", "c", "k", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", " ", "r", "u", "n", "s", " ", "o", "n", " ", "s", "e", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", "s", " ", "l", "a", "i", "d", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", ",", " ", "m", "o", "s", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", ",", " ", "d", "e", "c", "a", "d", "e", "s", " ", "e", "a", "r", "l", "i", "e", "r", " ", "a", "n", "d", 